    "chunk_text": "As a composer, Dushan has also created original songs, under his own name, including \u2018Mal Sriya\u2019, \u2018Mathakayan\u2019, and \u2018Oyata Seethalada\u2019, and is also highly recognised for creatively remaking classic songs of the Gypsies, while preserving their original spirit and energy, for newer audiences.\n\nNalin: Toured internationally, over 100 times, with Bathiya & Santhush\n\nHe started as assistant music composer for Young Asia Television, and moved to Dubai, in 2003, performing with the group Revelation, and teaching music at the Popular Music Institute (Yamaha) and GEMS Music Hub.\n\nNalin has also collaborated with international artistes like Asha Bhosle, Morten Harket (of A-ha fame) and world-renowned cellist Jean Decroos.\n\nWith Morten Harket it was an acoustic session, at the opening of YATV (Young Asia Television), in 1996, and with Asha Bhosle and Bhatiya and Santhush, at the Sugathadasa Stadium, in Colombo, in 2011.\n\nHaving earned a diploma in Music Teaching, from the Trinity College of Music (RockSchool), in 2012, Nalin currently teaches guitar, online.\n\nNalin shares a long and successful musical relationship with Bhatiya & Santhush, performing, on stage, as their main guitarist, lead, acoustic and classical guitar, and has toured internationally, over 100 times, with Bathiya & Santhush.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
