    "description": "Beyond banks: The weak links in Sri Lanka\u2019s financial system",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-banks-The-weak-links-in-Sri-Lanka-s-financial-system/4-792147",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
