    "description": "UN session in Geneva considers digital platforms as tax collectors; Sri Lanka\u2019s Kapruka brings operator perspective",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/UN-session-in-Geneva-considers-digital-platforms-as-tax-collectors-Sri-Lanka-s-Kapruka-brings-operator-perspective/34-792162",
