    "description": "Govt. seeks consular access to Sri Lankan held by Israel during Gaza flotilla interception",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Govt-seeks-consular-access-to-Sri-Lankan-held-by-Israel-during-Gaza-flotilla-interception/56-792170",
    "lang": "en",
