    "chunk_text": "In addition, Ambeon Capital initiated the acquisition of a controlling stake in Harischandra Mills PLC via Ambeon Essentials Ltd., marking a strategic entry into the fast-moving consumer goods (FMCG) sector. This move is expected to reinforce recurring revenue streams and expand the Group\u2019s presence in essential consumer markets.\n\nBuilding on this momentum, Ambeon Capital PLC, together with its principal subsidiary Ambeon Holdings PLC, remains strongly positioned to sustain its growth momentum. Supported by a robust balance sheet, a well-diversified portfolio, and a forward-looking strategic agenda, the Group is focused on unlocking new opportunities while maintaining disciplined capital deployment. The Group remains committed to creating enduring shareholder value, driven by innovation, strategic agility, and operational excellence; ensuring it continues to strengthen its competitive position and deliver superior long-term returns in an evolving economic landscape.\n\nThe Board of Ambeon Capital PLC comprises Chairman Sujeewa Mudalige, Group CEO/Executive Director Dr. Sajeeva Narangoda, Savanth Sebastian, Samresh Kumar, Jacky Tsoi, Duminda Weerasekare and Ravi Goonetilleke."
