    "chunk_text": "a) World has reached the pinnacle in human civilization in all spheres of life: political, social, cultural, economic, science and technology, education, health and modern comforts and conveniences of living and great cities for people to live.\n\nIf the present world claims to be civilized, cultured, refined, then the pursuit of military might by having formidable Land Armies, Naval and Air forces equipped with weapons of mass scale destruction of countries and its people, must end. Total and complete Disarmament, by disbanding Standing Armies and dismantling of all military infrastructures and weapons producing facilities, is a sine qua non.\n\nThe production and stockpiling of the weapons of destruction of the world, including Nuclear Bombs, is a monopoly of few nations with military might. An exclusive Nuclear Bomb Club. Other countries have no right to build and own a Nuclear Bomb. There is in force an UN \u201cNon-Proliferation of Nuclear Weapons Treaty\u201d. This sounds rather queer. It means other destructive Bombs are acceptable in killing people and the destruction of their countries. If an ad hoc and palliative Non- Proliferation of Nuclear Weapons Treaty is needed, then why not a Total Disarmament of the World Treaty be accomplished to abolish national Armies and dismantling of all associated military infrastructures and production facilities? What is needed is only a sincere and determined collective will of all nations to achieve total Disarmament and bring about a New World Order that will usher in Eternal World Peace and harmony. Total disarmament will lead to equalization of all nations of the world, irrespective of their size. Nations needs to be evaluated on their intellectual might and not on their military might, as at present."
