    "chunk_text": "A new World Order has to be created by abolishing Armies and Armaments. Without Armies and Armaments, eternal World Peace, will be a natural consequence. This is not an empty Idealism and practical impossibility. If nations renounce their greed for territorial expansion and craving for hegemonism and domination of the world, Eternal world peace will become a reality. Production of lethal weapons is now a thriving business of powerful nations. If there are no wars, the market for the sale of their weapons will evaporate. Powerful nations convert tensions between nations into conflicts and engender armed confrontations to between them to market their weapons. The militarily mighty nations create internal strife in other nations and instigate for regime changes to control and dominate them.\n\nWith total Disarmament, world will cease to be labelled as Uni-Polar, Bi-polar or Multipolar, militarily. With end of military power, world Geopolitics will end. World will only be bipolar, geographically, with North and South Poles. Total disarmament will impact the civil governance of the world, by reduced crime, end of political terrorism and Gun culture. Moreover, with the end of military might, world will be truly civilized and refined. Economic development of the world economy will proceed without wars and disruption. Nations need only a Police Force, with minimal weapons, to maintain internal Law and Order, and enforcement of civil laws."
  },
