    "chunk_text": "LIMRA Awards Ceremony Union Assurance honours top-performing sales professionals\n\nUnion Assurance recently hosted its LIMRA Awards Ceremony on its head office premises, celebrating the outstanding sales professionals whose performance during the previous years met the rigorous benchmarks of this globally respected awards programme.\n\nThe LIMRA Award is an internationally established framework that evaluates the sales professionals on productivity, policy quality and premium persistency, the criteria that go beyond volume to measure the sustained value the advisers deliver to their policyholders.\n\nThis year\u2019s ceremony honoured the winners across three award categories. The International Award for Productivity (IAP) recognised over 60 recipients across the Silver, Gold and Platinum tiers, with Platinum representing the highest level of achievement. These merits affirm Union Assurance\u2019s standing as an organisation that is truly protecting what matters most.\n\nLooking ahead, Union Assurance has launched its LIMRA Award Drive 2026, reinforcing the company\u2019s commitment to creating value for all stakeholders, from the advisers who grow professionally through this journey, to the customers who benefit from higher standards of care and the organisation that is strengthened by their success.\n\nThe drive places renewed emphasis on capability development, needs-based selling and customer-centric practices, empowering the advisers to build lasting expertise and advance their careers while delivering meaningful outcomes for the policyholders they serve."
