    "description": "Janashakthi Finance AFBU sets standard for ethical and Shariah-compliant finance in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Janashakthi-Finance-AFBU-sets-standard-for-ethical-and-Shariah-compliant-finance-in-Sri-Lanka/215-340881",
