    "chunk_text": "Fairfirst continues its winning run in Leadership Excellence for sixth year\n\nFairfirst Insurance continued its focus on leadership development at the Great Manager Awards 2025, organised by the Colombo Leadership Academy. The company was also recognised as an organisation with Great Managers for the sixth consecutive year, reflecting its sustained commitment to shaping a workplace where individuals are empowered to grow, take ownership, and lead with purpose.\n\nThe Great Manager Awards recognise organisations that prioritise effective people management and cultivate environments where teams can perform, collaborate, and evolve. Fairfirst\u2019s continued recognition highlights its belief that strong leadership is built through trust, accountability, and a shared sense of responsibility across teams.\n\nAmong this year\u2019s award recipients, Mr Madhava Hettiarachchi, Head of Finance, was recognised as a Millennial Manager.\n\nHavelock City Mall celebrates Mother\u2019s Day with exclusive retail offers and debut Mother & Daughter Fashion Show\n\nBargain-hunters to the fore as some stocks diminish in value\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
