    "description": "Shanakiyan urges equal treatment for Tamil political prisoners, questions disparity with JVP rehabilitation",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Shanakiyan-urges-equal-treatment-for-Tamil-political-prisoners-questions-disparity-with-JVP-rehabilitation/56-792265",
