    "description": "Internal control only as strong as its weakest link: Time to introspect",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Internal-control-only-as-strong-as-its-weakest-link-Time-to-introspect/4-792276",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1779406454.0,
