    "md5": "9ea531d26b17e45445c50c0a3ad13939",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1850,
    "chunk_text": "Shangri-La unveils \u2018Golden Hour\u2019 in Sri Lanka\n\nAs daylight softens and the island begins its quiet transformation into night, Shangri-La introduces Golden Hour\u2014an evocative new cocktail ritual now unveiled at Shangri-La Colombo and Shangri-La Hambantota.\n\nMore than a reimagined happy hour, Golden Hour is a sensory experience\u2014where time slows, flavours deepen, and moments are designed to linger. Rooted in Shangri-La\u2019s Asian heritage and inspired by the brand\u2019s iconic golden \u201cS\u201d, this daily ritual captures the fleeting beauty between day and dusk, inviting guests to reconnect\u2014with place, with people, and with the present.\n\nAt Shangri-La Colombo, the experience unfolds against the rhythm of the city\u2014where ocean views meet skyline silhouettes, and the energy of Colombo transitions into an elegant evening cadence. Guests can gather across signature venues such as Capital Bar & Grill and Tiki Bar, where curated cocktails and refined bites create a vibrant yet intimate social ritual in the heart of the city.\n\nFurther south, at Shangri-La Hambantota, Golden Hour takes on a more serene expression. Set across 145 acres of tropical landscape, where peacocks roam and the Indian Ocean stretches endlessly beyond, the experience is shaped by nature\u2014sunsets over the golf course, golden light filtering through palms, and a slower, more contemplative pace that defines the resort.\n\nAt the heart of Golden Hour is a globally curated cocktail collection, crafted by Shangri-La\u2019s Mixology Masters. Each creation tells a story\u2014of culture, craft, and connection\u2014while reflecting the spirit of its destination.\n\nPurana Legacy \u2013 Shangri-La Colombo: A rich and layered expression featuring Chivas 18, roasted coconut, and pineapple oleo\u2014an indulgent tribute to island flavours, reinterpreted with depth and sophistication."
