    "chunk_size_bytes": 1094,
    "chunk_text": "Purana Legacy \u2013 Shangri-La Colombo: A rich and layered expression featuring Chivas 18, roasted coconut, and pineapple oleo\u2014an indulgent tribute to island flavours, reinterpreted with depth and sophistication.\n\nComplementing the cocktails is a selection of Golden Bites, thoughtfully curated to enhance each sip\u2014bringing together local ingredients, regional inspiration, and refined culinary craftsmanship.\n\nWhile Golden Hour is a global Shangri-La experience spanning destinations from Europe to the Middle East, its expression in Sri Lanka is deeply personal\u2014shaped by the island\u2019s contrasts. From the cosmopolitan pulse of Colombo to the untamed beauty of Hambantota, each setting offers a distinct interpretation of this shared ritual.\n\nGolden Hour is not simply about cocktails. It is about transition. A pause. A moment suspended between what has been and what is yet to unfold.\n\nEach evening, as the light turns gold, Shangri-La invites guests to gather, to savour, and to rediscover the art of slowing down\u2014where every sip tells a story, and every setting becomes part of it."
