    "chunk_text": "AIA Sri Lanka hosts annual conference to honour top performers\n\nAIA Insurance Lanka hosted its annual Company Conference and awards ceremony under the theme \u201cRising to the Top\u201d, bringing together its employees for an evening dedicated to recognition of inspiration and celebration of excellence.\n\nHeld at Cinnamon Life at City of Dreams, the Conference was formally inaugurated revealing the event\u2019s theme, \u201cRising to the Top,\u201d symbolising AIA\u2019s commitment to continuous growth. Director/Chief Executive Officer, Chathuri Munaweera, addressed the gathering, outlining AIA Insurance Lanka\u2019s strategic vision, business performance, and future aspirations.\n\nThe awards segment recognised both individual and team excellence, celebrating outstanding performance and collective success across the organisation.At the pinnacle, nine exceptional individuals were honoured with the CEO\u2019s Special Awards in recognition of their extraordinary contributions, while 217 award winners were celebrated through the AIA Essentials Team Award, highlighting strong collaboration and shared achievement.\n\nTop of the Table (TOT) and Court of the Table (COT) honours acknowledged elite performers, followed by MDRT recognition, celebrating Financial Planning Executives who demonstrated exceptional professionalism. The closing remarks of the awards presentation reflected on the organisation\u2019s shared journey of growth, while expressing appreciation for employees\u2019 dedication and commitment to excellence.\n\nThe conference concluded on a high note with performances by AIA team members and musical artists, accompanied by multiple high-energy dance performances that added more colour to the evening."
