    "description": "China to send astronaut on year-long space mission as it eyes 2030 moon landing",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/China-to-send-astronaut-on-year-long-space-mission-as-it-eyes-2030-moon-landing/107-341079",
