    "chunk_text": "Two injured after part of building collapses in Kandy\n\nColombo, May 24 (Daily Mirror) - Two people were seriously injured and hospitalised after a part of a building on Cross Street, Kandy collapsed, Police said.\n\nThey said the accident occurred when a balcony-like construction of the fourth floor of the building collapsed on to the second floor.\n\nPolice added that the two individuals injured in the accident are residents of Hasalaka and Dehiattakandiya, aged between 45 and 50."
