    "num": "islandlk-5393070c",
    "date_str": "2026-05-24",
    "description": "Human-caused leopard deaths soar in Sri Lanka\u2019s Central Highlands, new study warns",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/human-caused-leopard-deaths-soar-in-sri-lankas-central-highlands-new-study-warns/",
