    "chunk_size_bytes": 1382,
    "chunk_text": "SLIM ushers in new leadership era for 2026/27\n\nThe Sri Lanka Institute of Marketing (SLIM), the country\u2019s national body for marketing, successfully convened its Annual General Meeting (AGM) 2026 on April 8 at the Galle Face Hotel. The event marked a significant milestone as the Institute formally appointed a new Council of Management and Executive Committee to steer SLIM into its next phase of growth.\n\nBuilding on a transformative 2025, the newly appointed leadership team consists of an accomplished group of marketing professionals entrusted with roles for the 2026/27 term. The incoming President, a seasoned professional with extensive international business experience, emphasized a strong commitment to strengthening professional standards, expanding global engagement, and equipping Sri Lanka\u2019s marketing fraternity to compete effectively on an international stage.\n\nThe forum brought together institute members and industry leaders, underscoring SLIM\u2019s ongoing mission to advance the marketing profession while navigating a rapidly evolving global and domestic market landscape.\n\nTech startup Corzent named \u2018Best ICT Startup\u2019 at South Asian Business Excellence Awards\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
