    "chunk_size_bytes": 1299,
    "chunk_text": "Tech startup Corzent named \u2018Best ICT Startup\u2019 at South Asian Business Excellence Awards\n\nCorzent, a technology firm based in Sri Lanka and Dubai, was crowned the \u201cBest ICT Startup Organization\u201d at the 9th South Asian Business Excellence Awards held in Colombo. Competing against entities across India, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Nepal, and Sri Lanka, the regional accolade highlights Corzent\u2019s strong technical foundation, disciplined execution, and world-class engineering team.\n\nFounded in 2021, the boutique firm specializes in providing stable, dedicated engineering teams for global startups and scaleups, heavily anchoring its growth in frameworks like Angular and .NET. Their continuous team stability and retention of institutional knowledge have allowed the firm to counter the local tech \u201cbrain drain\u201d and build a highly dependable delivery track record for international clients, particularly across Australia and Scandinavia in fields like Fintech, Greentech, Proptech, and construction technology.\n\nJohn Keells CG Auto denies allegations of prior knowledge on vehicle import surcharge\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
