    "chunk_text": "\u201cThis is a major milestone for us and we are only getting started. Our focus now is on building aggressively, expanding globally and dominating the market,\u201d said Kelly Felder Director Dinith Wickramanayake.\n\nFollowing the successful Melbourne launch, Kelly Felder is already preparing for its next phase of international growth, with further expansion plans beyond borders coming up within the year.\n\nEstablished in 2007, Kelly Felder is Sri Lanka\u2019s leading high-street fashion brand, dedicated to equipping its community with styles designed to conquer every phase of life. Created by in-house talent, each collection brings together modern design, elevated styling and a complete lifestyle offering, spanning womenswear, menswear, athleisure, accessories and fragrances."
