    "chunk_text": "At a time when organisations are increasingly focused on employee engagement, burnout, retention and workplace culture, the partnership signals a broader shift towards more people-centric workplaces across the industry.\n\nAn AIA Insurance representative added, \u201cAt AIA, we believe in helping people live healthier, longer, better lives. Our partnership with SLASSCOM aligns perfectly with our mission to support healthier workplaces and stronger employee communities within Sri Lanka\u2019s growing knowledge and innovation industry.\u201d\n\nThe partnership reflects a shared commitment to raising the standard of workplace wellness across the industry. Beyond traditional wellness programmes, the initiative aims to create healthier and more connected workplaces where the employees are supported not only professionally but personally as well.\n\nIt also creates new opportunities for industry-wide engagement, collaboration and community building through shared experiences that bring teams together beyond day-to-day work.\n\nThe Mind \u2022 Body \u2022 Soul Series 2026 will bring together leading knowledge and innovation companies, HR leaders and wellness advocates in a collective effort to shape healthier and more connected workplaces across Sri Lanka."
