    "md5": "31498587b9fa8d0a57ceec97351dd1d6",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1081,
    "chunk_text": "E. B. Creasy \u2013 BIC and DENTA Factory wins Women-Led Sustainability Awards\n\nE. B. Creasy & Co., PLC \u2013 BIC & DENTA Factory was recently recognised as a Winner at Women-Led Sustainability Projects Appreciation Awards 2026.\n\nPresented under the Responsible Care Initiative at The Barnhouse, Panadura, the award celebrates the company\u2019s \u2018Awesi\u2019 project, as one of the year\u2019s top 10 women-led projects, distinguished for its proven impact on safety, innovation and workplace sustainability.\n\nLed by Executive Quality Assurance Shanika Amarasekara and Executive Energy and Sustainability Thilakshi Navodya, the Awesi project was recognised for its role as a significant and replicable model for inclusive industrial development.\n\nOrganised by the Lanka Responsible Care Council, the awards recognise organisations that demonstrate safe, responsible and sustainable practices within the chemical sector.\n\nThis achievement further reaffirms E. B. Creasy & Co., PLC \u2013 BIC and Denta Factory\u2019s continued commitment towards improving health, safety and workplace sustainability."
