    "chunk_size_bytes": 1544,
    "chunk_text": "BestWeb.LK competition calls for submissions\n\nBestWeb.LK, Sri Lanka\u2019s premium website competition and the benchmark for digital excellence in Sri Lanka, is officially calling for applications and invites all .lk website owners to submit their websites for the opportunity to gain national recognition.\n\nOrganised by the LK Domain Registry and now in its 16th edition, BestWeb.LK recognises outstanding .lk websites across 24 industry categories.\n\nThe competition features 126 awards, including Gold, Silver and Bronze accolades, along with special recognitions such as Best Mobile-Optimised Website, Most Popular Website, Best Web Developer and Overall Awards.\n\nThe BestWeb.LK award categories cover almost every industry across the island. Categories include Advertising and Marketing, Automotive, Banking, Corporate, e-Commerce, Education, Fashion and Lifestyle, Finance and Insurance, Food and Beverage, Government, Health and Wellness, Manufacturing and Industrial, Media and Entertainment, Nonprofit, School, Sports, Technology, Travel and Tourism and more.\n\nThe websites are evaluated based on design, performance, content quality, technical excellence, security, user experience and overall innovation.\n\nSending applications in early gives organisations a significant advantage as their website can benefit from insights in the TopWeb.LK report, which highlights areas for improvement in each website. This provides the organisation valuable time to fine-tune the website, boost performance and optimise user experience before judging."
