    "md5": "cfc228de508867f0c100c2e5b8ff85d2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1918,
    "chunk_text": "Jabra-ZILLIONe introduce Evolve3 headset series and PanaCast video solutions\n\nJabra, a global leader in professional audio and video solutions, announced an expanded portfolio of intelligent collaboration solutions designed to support the evolving needs of hybrid work environments.\n\nThe announcement includes the new Jabra Evolve3 headset series, Jabra PanaCast Room Kits video solution and the new Jabra PanaCast U30 video bar, bringing together AI-driven personal audio, intelligent video for large meeting rooms and simplified deployment for small rooms to create more inclusive and productive meeting experiences across personal calls and meeting workspaces.\n\nFrom individual focus and mobility to scalable room-based video collaboration, Jabra\u2019s latest solutions are engineered to support clear communication, professional-grade performance and seamless deployment to create value in organisations.\n\nAvailable through ZILLIONe, the sole authorised distributor for Jabra in Sri Lanka and the Maldives, the new portfolio further expands access to enterprise-grade collaboration solutions for organisations across the region.\n\nThe Jabra Evolve3 series is the company\u2019s most advanced professional headset portfolio, purpose-built for hybrid professionals who move between offices, home and on-the-go environments. Available in over-the-ear (Jabra Evolve3 85) and on-the-ear (Jabra Evolve3 75) variants, the series introduces a discreet boomless design powered by next-generation audio intelligence and a design you want to wear.\n\nPowered by Jabra ClearVoice and deep neural network technology trained on more than 60 million real-world sentences, the Evolve3 series isolates the user\u2019s voice from surrounding noise without the need for a visible boom arm. Adaptive Active Noise Cancellation adjusts in real time to the environment and headset fits, helping reduce distractions during calls and while listening."
  },
