    "md5": "94e692418e1e16ec8f5c8bfa466c81fe",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1718,
    "chunk_text": "Powered by Jabra ClearVoice and deep neural network technology trained on more than 60 million real-world sentences, the Evolve3 series isolates the user\u2019s voice from surrounding noise without the need for a visible boom arm. Adaptive Active Noise Cancellation adjusts in real time to the environment and headset fits, helping reduce distractions during calls and while listening.\n\nDesigned for a simple plug-and-play BYOD experience, the users can walk into a room, connect their own device with a single USB-C cable and start meetings instantly using platforms such as Microsoft Teams and Zoom. The system also includes on-screen guidance to help users quickly begin meetings without additional support.\n\nPanaCast U30 delivers a 120-degree field of view optimised for small spaces, ensuring participants remain visible even in compact room layouts. Intelligent Zoom, Virtual Director and Dynamic Composition automatically adjust the framing as conversations evolve, while a built-in speaker and six microphones deliver full-duplex, room-filling audio.\n\nComplementing PanaCast U30, the Jabra PanaCast 55 VBS and Jabra PanaCast Room Kits extend intelligent collaboration into mid-sized and large meeting rooms. Designed for scalable deployment and flexible configurations, the solutions combine panoramic video technology, extension audio support and intelligent multi-camera capabilities to deliver a consistent and immersive collaboration experience across different room sizes and layouts. The portfolio includes the Jabra PanaCast 55 VBS video bar, the Jabra PanaCast SpeakerMic extension microphone and Room Kit configurations supporting one, three or five-camera setups powered by intelligent speaker tracking."
