    "chunk_text": "Complementing PanaCast U30, the Jabra PanaCast 55 VBS and Jabra PanaCast Room Kits extend intelligent collaboration into mid-sized and large meeting rooms. Designed for scalable deployment and flexible configurations, the solutions combine panoramic video technology, extension audio support and intelligent multi-camera capabilities to deliver a consistent and immersive collaboration experience across different room sizes and layouts. The portfolio includes the Jabra PanaCast 55 VBS video bar, the Jabra PanaCast SpeakerMic extension microphone and Room Kit configurations supporting one, three or five-camera setups powered by intelligent speaker tracking.\n\n\u201cFrom individual workspaces to full meeting rooms, organisations across APAC need collaboration technology that is reliable, adaptable and built to scale,\u201d said Jabra Vice President and Managing Director South Asia and Channels APAC Peter Jayaseelan.\n\n\u201cWith the Evolve3 headset series, as well as the modern video solutions PanaCast Room Kits and PanaCast U30, Jabra is delivering an integrated ecosystem designed to simplify hybrid collaboration while maintaining professional-grade audio and video experiences.\u201d\n\nProducts supplied through ZILLIONe are backed by a two-year warranty, verified authenticity through direct sourcing from Jabra and access to authorised after-sales service support to ensure continued product reliability and assistance."
