    "chunk_text": "SLT-Mobitel launches SL\u2019s first next-gen 5G mobile router\n\nSLT\u2011Mobitel is redefining connectivity with the introduction of Sri Lanka\u2019s first TRCSL\u2011approved pocket\u2011sized 5G mobile router.\n\nDesigned for high-demand digital lifestyles, the device delivers ultra-fast, reliable connectivity for streaming, gaming, content creation and remote work on the move.\n\nWhether gaming with friends, watching TV shows, creating content, attending online classes, live streaming or working on the go, the new 5G mobile router delivers ultra\u2011fast, reliable connectivity tailored for today\u2019s digital lifestyle needs.\n\nPowered by Wi\u2011Fi 6 Plus technology, the router delivers speeds of up to 3,600 Mbps, offering smoother streaming, lower gaming latency, faster downloads and stable performance even in crowded environments. Supporting up to 32 devices simultaneously, it is ideal for study groups, travel teams, content creators, gaming sessions and family use.\n\nAs Sri Lanka\u2019s digital enabler, SLT\u2011Mobitel has consistently led the nation\u2019s technology evolution, introducing revolutionary experiences and innovative products that redefine how people connect. The launch of the 5G mobile router further reinforces this commitment, enabling Sri Lankans to experience network superiority through a seamless, superior 5G connectivity experience while unlocking the full power and possibilities of next-generation technology. By bringing international\u2011grade technology to Sri Lanka, SLT-Mobitel is shaping the next-era of connectivity and accelerating the nation\u2019s digital advancement without compromise.\n\nThe device features a smart OLED touchscreen for instant monitoring of data usage and connected devices. The sleek design, just 12mm thin and weighing only 220g, makes it effortlessly portable. A powerful 7000mAh battery provides up to 10 hours of usage, with reverse charging capability enabling the router to double as a power bank."
