    "date_str": "2026-05-25",
    "description": "Sri Lanka tells Vietnam: Stable, reformed economy ready for capital",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-tells-Vietnam-Stable-reformed-economy-ready-for-capital/34-792412",
    "lang": "en",
