    "md5": "57ac1f2364e590be29432b39b0a10ac4",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1069,
    "chunk_text": "Dr. Silva has served FCCISL for many years in several important capacities, including Board Member, Director, Vice President, Strategy Committee Chairman and member of many committees. Through these roles, he has contributed to strengthening the chamber movement, supporting entrepreneurship, promoting policy dialogue and improving business representation at regional and national levels.\n\nBeyond his chamber responsibilities, Dr. Silva is connected with professional and civic institutions, including the Japan Sri Lanka Technical and Cultural Association, Captained the Royal Colombo Golf Club. He has also held honorary positions including Brand Ambassador for Rotary International and currently the Patron of the Mercantile Hockey Association.\n\nAs President of FCCISL, Dr. Silva\u2019s leadership is expected to focus on supporting entrepreneurs, SMEs and crisis-affected businesses to regain stability, improve operational resilience, access new opportunities, strengthen trade linkages and contribute to Sri Lanka\u2019s inclusive private-sector-led economic recovery."
