    "chunk_size_bytes": 599,
    "chunk_text": "\u201cI have great respect for Minister Bimal Rathnayake for honestly bringing these issues into the national political conversation inside Parliament. Acknowledgement is the beginning of reconciliation,\u201d he said.\n\nArullsamy stated that while acknowledgement was welcome, the next phase must focus on practical reforms including land rights, housing security, economic independence, educational transformation, equal state investment and greater representation for the Indian Origin Malayaga Tamil community.\n\n\u201cHistory must not divide us again. But history must also never be forgotten,\u201d he said."
