    "chunk_size_bytes": 1991,
    "chunk_text": "Thai Sumeda wins \u2018Business of the Year 2026\u2019 Award for Manufacturing Excellence\n\nSumeda Elpitiya accepting the award from High Commissioner of Malaysia to Sri Lanka & Maldives\n\nThai Sumeda Enterprises Pvt Ltd, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s pioneering manufacturers and distributors of incense sticks and related products, has once again earned international recognition by winning the \u2018Business of the Year 2026\u2019 Award in the Large Category for manufacturing incense products. The award was presented by the BWIO (USA\u2013Sri Lanka) Council in recognition of the company\u2019s outstanding contribution to the manufacturing sector and export industry.\n\nThe \u201cBusiness World International Awards Ceremony 2026\u201d was held recently at the Mount Lavinia Hotel with the participation of several distinguished guests, business leaders, and diplomats.\n\nAccepting the award on behalf of the company, Sumeda Elpitiya, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Thai Sumeda Enterprises, expressed his gratitude for the recognition and acknowledged the dedication and commitment of the company\u2019s employees, stakeholders, and customers. Thai Sumeda Enterprises has received several similar accolades over the years, further strengthening its reputation as an industry leader.\n\nOver the years, Thai Sumeda Enterprises has emerged as a driving force in Sri Lanka\u2019s economy by creating employment opportunities for local communities, exporting high-quality products to many developed international markets, and generating valuable foreign exchange earnings for the country during challenging economic times.\n\nThe award was presented by Badli Hisham Adam, High Commissioner of Malaysia to Sri Lanka and Maldives, who graced the occasion as the Chief Guest.\n\nThis recognition not only celebrates Thai Sumeda\u2019s excellence in business and manufacturing but also highlights the company\u2019s continued contribution towards enhancing Sri Lanka\u2019s global image through the production and export of quality products."
