    "md5": "db9b7f4c05d13194f6e5106b079293d0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1779,
    "chunk_text": "ICC unveils architectural scale model of Bay One Residences Colombo\n\nInternational Construction Consortium (Pvt) Ltd marked a major milestone with the unveiling of the 3D architectural scale model of its newest luxury residential project at the Bay One Residences Colombo sales gallery in Port City.\n\nThe event also celebrated the strong market response, with approximately 50 percent of units sold since the launch earlier this year. The event attracted a significant number of prospective buyers, industry stakeholders, and existing investors. The architectural scale model served as the centerpiece of the showcase, presenting meticulously crafted miniature representations of the project. Moving beyond floor plans and digital renderings, the showcase offered a clear view of the residential layout, and the integrated lifestyle envisioned for the completed project. Those present were able to closely examine the landscaped surroundings, facilities, and architectural detailing of the 17-storey Marina front tower, reflecting ICC\u2019s emphasis on design precision and experiential real estate presentation.\n\nBay One Residences commenced construction in January 2026, becoming the first residential scheme to break ground within the Port City Colombo Special Economic Zone (SEZ). This project is designed to accommodate 231 spacious residential units and 291 parking spaces. Unit sizes range from 69 to 799sq.m, comprising one to four-bedroom apartments and an exclusive penthouse.\n\nResidents will have access to an extensive suite of lifestyle and wellness amenities, including an infinity-edge swimming pool, a gymnasium and fitness centre, a squash court, a yoga deck, a dedicated kids\u2019 club, a restaurant, a reception hall, and direct access to the marina and promenade."
