    "chunk_text": "Residents will have access to an extensive suite of lifestyle and wellness amenities, including an infinity-edge swimming pool, a gymnasium and fitness centre, a squash court, a yoga deck, a dedicated kids\u2019 club, a restaurant, a reception hall, and direct access to the marina and promenade.\n\nThe development also incorporates advanced smart-living technologies, including automated service robots to facilitate secure in-building deliveries, personalized concierge services, on-call maintenance support, advanced security infrastructure, and a centralized building management system designed to provide a seamless residential experience.\n\nSustainability remains central to the project\u2019s design approach, with energy-efficient systems, rainwater harvesting infrastructure, biodegradable waste management solutions, and environmentally certified construction materials incorporated throughout the development to reduce its long-term environmental footprint.\n\nICC brings over 45 years of industry experience to the development, having completed more than 220 projects across residential, hotel, and commercial sectors. As one of the few companies in Sri Lanka to operate as both developer and contractor, ICC maintains direct oversight across design, construction, and delivery. Building on this strong foundation, Bay One Residences Colombo is progressing at pace, and with foundation work already underway, the project is expected to be completed by January 2029."
