    "chunk_text": "Globally recognised as Europe\u2019s No. 1 racing motorcycle brand, KTM has established a dominant presence in premier international racing arenas including MotoGP, the Dakar Rally, motocross championships and leading global racing circuits. The brand also enjoys strong popularity across regional markets such as India and Nepal, while maintaining a footprint in more than 80 countries worldwide. KTM\u2019s rich racing heritage, engineering excellence and consistent track performance have earned the trust of professional riders and motorcycle enthusiasts around the globe.\n\nSelected KTM models are equipped with advanced rider-focused technologies including dual-disc dual-channel ABS with four-piston radial-mounted callipers, ride modes with Supermoto ABS, ride-by-wire systems, slipper clutches, Quickshifter+ functionality and modern TFT colour displays with multiple smart features, ensuring enhanced safety, control and riding exhilaration.\n\nAs the sole authorised distributor for KTM motorcycles in Sri Lanka, DPMC has already initiated plans to establish an extensive islandwide showroom and service network, with KTM Peliyagoda marking another important milestone in this expansion journey."
