    "description": "A Blueprint For Rupee Stability: Why Domestic Discipline Isn\u2019t Enough To Save The Rupee",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/a-blueprint-for-rupee-stability-why-domestic-discipline-isnt-enough-to-save-the-rupee/",
    "lang": "en",
