    "chunk_size_bytes": 1774,
    "chunk_text": "hSenidBiz delivers  major FY2026 turnaround with $ 5.5 m ARR\n\nRecurring revenues reach 74% of total; Normalised EBITDA margin expands 17 percentage points\n\nhSenid Business Solutions PLC (hSenidBiz) has announced its financial results for the fourth quarter and full year ended 31 March 2026, delivering a significant turnaround in operational profitability, materially improving earnings quality, and achieving a key strategic milestone.\n\nIn the fourth quarter, total revenue reached Rs. 522.2 million, up 5% year-on-year (YoY). The PeoplesHR Cloud segment delivered Rs. 380 million, representing 20 percent YoY growth in LKR terms and 12% growth in USD constant currency terms, with subscription revenues comprising 87% of segment revenue. New deal closures recovered strongly to $ 843,395. The Company sustained profitability at the Profit Before Tax (PBT) level with Rs. 7 million and a normalized EBITDA margin of 11%, while continuing to generate positive free cash flow.\n\nFor the full year, the Company delivered a substantial financial turnaround. Revenue grew 13% YoY to Rs. 2.1 billion. Normalized EBITDA turned positive at LKR 200 million, with the margin expanding 17 percentage points to 10%. Profit Before Tax improved by Rs. 313 million year-on-year, significantly reducing the loss from Rs. 321 million in FY2025 to Rs. 8 million. The Company also generated positive free cash flow for the year, a sharp reversal from negative free cash flow in the prior year and an annual improvement of over Rs. 350 million. Exit Annualized Recurring Revenue (ARR) reached $ 5.5 million, growing 32% YoY, while recurring revenues strengthened to 77% of total revenue in the fourth quarter, underscoring the quality and resilience of the Company\u2019s SaaS-led business model."
  },
