    "chunk_text": "For the full year, the Company delivered a substantial financial turnaround. Revenue grew 13% YoY to Rs. 2.1 billion. Normalized EBITDA turned positive at LKR 200 million, with the margin expanding 17 percentage points to 10%. Profit Before Tax improved by Rs. 313 million year-on-year, significantly reducing the loss from Rs. 321 million in FY2025 to Rs. 8 million. The Company also generated positive free cash flow for the year, a sharp reversal from negative free cash flow in the prior year and an annual improvement of over Rs. 350 million. Exit Annualized Recurring Revenue (ARR) reached $ 5.5 million, growing 32% YoY, while recurring revenues strengthened to 77% of total revenue in the fourth quarter, underscoring the quality and resilience of the Company\u2019s SaaS-led business model.\n\nChief Executive Officer Sampath Jayasundara added: \u201cThe operational momentum achieved in FY2026 provides a strong foundation as we enter the next phase of growth. Our priorities for FY2027 are to accelerate customer acquisition in key markets, drive execution excellence across the sales organisation, and rapidly advance our AI-driven capabilities, particularly through Lexi Insights to deliver even greater value to enterprise customers across our markets.\u201d\n\nDuring the quarter, hSenidBiz strengthened its product roadmap with the launch of Lexi Insights, an AI-powered analytics capability designed to deliver predictive workforce intelligence and strategic insights for C-suite decision-making. The Company also received the Gold Award in the Large Category of the ICT, BPO and Related Services Sector at the 33rd Annual Export Awards 2025 organised by the National Chamber of Exporters of Sri Lanka, marking its sixth consecutive year of receiving this prestigious national recognition."
