    "chunk_text": "Judgment in Sarana Gunawardena corruption cases postponed\n\nColombo, May 26 (Daily Mirror) - The delivery of the judgment in four corruption cases filed against former Deputy Minister Sarana Gunawardena was today postponed to June 9 by the Colombo High Court.\n\nHigh Court Judge Mohammed Mihal announced that the delivery of the judgment had been postponed as it had not yet been prepared."
