    "chunk_text": "Top Japan baseball manager resigns after assault\n\nAFP \u2013 Shinnosuke Abe, manager of the Yomiuri Giants, one of Japan\u2019s most popular baseball teams, takes part in a news conference in Tokyo today.\n\nThe manager of the Yomiuri Giants, one of Japan\u2019s most popular baseball teams, was arrested for allegedly assaulting his daughter, local media reported today.\n\nShinnosuke Abe allegedly grabbed his 18-year-old daughter and forced her to the floor at their home in central Tokyo, NHK and Kyodo News reported, citing unnamed police sources."
