    "description": "NHDA conducts first-ever cut-off test for employees to enable promotions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/NHDA-conducts-first-ever-cut-off-test-for-employees-to-enable-promotions/108-341282",
    "lang": "en",
