    "md5": "328b08e3a72f011a26360471a250eb62",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 497,
    "chunk_text": "Youth unite for anti-drug drive\n\nYouth across the island stand united behind President\u2019s \u201cSay No\u201d message during National Youth Day celebrations held under the theme \u201cSay No \u2013 No to Poisonous Drugs that Destroy the Future.\u201d Organized jointly by the National Youth Services Council and the Youth Club National Federation, anti-drug marches and rallies were staged in all 25 districts, highlighting the social responsibility and national commitment of the country\u2019s younger generation."
