    "chunk_size_bytes": 379,
    "chunk_text": "SJB considering street protests : Marikkar\n\nColombo, May 26 (Daily Mirror) - The Samagi Jana Balawegaya (SJB) said today it is considering street protests as the President has turned a deaf ear to its request of calling for an all party conference to discuss the current forex crisis.\n\nThe information was revealed by SJB official spokesman S.M. Marikkar during a media briefing."
