    "chunk_text": "Youth nabbed at BIA with Kush worth over Rs. 80 million\n\nColombo, May 26 (Daily Mirror) - A 24-year-old man has been arrested at the Bandaranaike International Airport (BIA) after customs and police officers discovered a large stock of Kush cannabis in his luggage, police said.\n\nThe suspect, a resident of Gampaha, had arrived in Sri Lanka from Bangkok, Thailand, when he was intercepted by authorities.\n\nDuring a search, officials found 8.365 kilograms of Kush cannabis packed into 19 separate packets inside his baggage.\n\nPolice said the estimated street value of the seized narcotics exceeds Rs. 80 million."
