    "chunk_text": "CameraLK and Sony unveil the revolutionary Alpha a7R VI\n\nCameraLK, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading camera retail giant and Official Sony Distributor in Sri Lanka, unveiled the highly anticipated Sony Alpha a7R VI and FE 100-400mm F4.5 GM OSS lens at a landmark regional launch event held in Sri Lanka. The event marked a historic milestone for the country\u2019s photography and videography industry, as Sri Lanka was chosen to host the premier regional launch of the groundbreaking new imaging technology, further cementing the nation\u2019s growing reputation within the global creative community.\n\nThe exclusive launch event brought together some of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading photographers, videographers, content creators, and visual storytellers for an immersive evening celebrating creativity, innovation, and the future of imaging technology. Organized by CameraLK, the event showcased Sony\u2019s latest advancements in camera engineering while highlighting the rapid evolution and growing potential of Sri Lanka\u2019s creative industry.\n\nJXG Management Trainee programme shapes the next generation of future leaders\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
