    "md5": "ad5cc6990795fed0b10dfe3cc60f38a0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1958,
    "chunk_text": "Large number of models, designers audition for Sri Lanka\u2019s first Women\u2019s Fashion Week\n\nThe Ceylon Chamber of Women Entrepreneurs (CCWE) held its Model & Designer Open Call recently at the City of Dreams CMB, Colombo, in a step toward Sri Lanka\u2019s first-ever fashion week dedicated exclusively to women entrepreneurs.\n\nThe auditions drew more than 200 models\u00a0 including a wave of fresh faces making their industry debut\u00a0 alongside over 50 designers eager to claim a spot on the runway.\n\nTwo separate panels of judges assessed the participants. The Designer Panel comprised Prof. Samudrika Wijayapala,\u00a0 Kanchana Perera, Jagjit Silva, Kalum Udawaththa, Roshan Peris and Nilushi Pawanya.\n\nThe Model Panel featured Dannielle Kerkoven Fernando, Sanjeewani Embuldeniya, Dineth De Silva, Manoji Wadugodapitiya, Kamil Hewavitharana, and Svitlana Melnyk (Lana). Gihan Dassanayake, who will lead the runway choreography at the main event, was also in attendance.\n\n\u201cThis Open Call is an invitation to every woman who has dared to dream. The response today is a testament to the incredible talent across Sri Lanka. CCWE Fashion Week 2026 will be a platform that transforms aspirations into opportunity.\u201d\n\nDr. Ayanthi Gurusinghe, President, CCWE & Chairman, CCWE Fashion Week & International Summit 2026\n\nThe CCWE Fashion Week & International Summit 2026 is scheduled from 16th to 19th July 2026 at Cinnamon Life, Colombo, under the theme \u201cThreads of Inclusion - Woven from Every Walk of Life.\u201d The event,\u00a0 a first for both Sri Lanka and South Asia\u00a0 aims to unite designers, artisans, SMEs, policymakers, and investors to create new market pathways and advance economic empowerment for women.\n\nThe United Nations ESCAP-SSWA serves as Knowledge Partner, with Head and Director Mikiko Tanaka noting the initiative reflects a shared commitment to enhancing women entrepreneurs\u2019 access to markets, finance, and digital networks. HNB leads as Title Sponsor."
