    "language": "en",
    "md5": "8b69af6ad7888776e61fb06a6d502478",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1537,
    "chunk_text": "Evolution Auto and EVO Charge launch fast charging station in Peliyagoda\n\nReinforcing its commitment to advancing electric mobility in Sri Lanka, Evolution Auto, in collaboration with EVO Charge, has officially launched a 60kW dual-gun DC fast charging station at the Evolution Auto After Sales Complex in Peliyagoda.\n\nBy introducing high-capacity fast charging to an area that did not previously have such facilities, this strategic initiative represents a significant milestone in the development of the country\u2019s EV infrastructure.\n\nTwo vehicles can now be charged at once thanks to the recently installed charger, which greatly improves EV users\u2019 convenience and speeds up turnaround times. The facility is built to accommodate both individual and commercial users, such as ride-hailing drivers and corporate fleets. It runs 24 hours a day in a safe, professionally managed setting.\n\nTo mark the launch, Evolution Auto is also offering a special introductory promotion. Evolution Auto customers can enjoy their first charge completely free from 20th May to 21st June, while all other EV owners will receive 50 percent off charging during the same promotional period.\n\nThe availability of reliable and easily accessible charging infrastructure continues to be a crucial enabler as EV adoption continues to pick up momentum throughout Sri Lanka. In order to close this gap, Evolution Auto\u2019s most recent installation provides EV users with a useful way to navigate urban mobility, especially in high-traffic areas like Peliyagoda."
  },
