    "description": "Buddhism disgraced: These disturbing allegations are a symptom of a larger  decay",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Buddhism-disgraced-These-disturbing-allegations-are-a-symptom-of-a-larger-decay/172-341329",
