    "chunk_text": "Inland Revenue seeks court order over alleged Rs. 1 b VAT default by CMC\n\nThe Department of Inland Revenue has initiated legal proceedings against the Colombo Municipal Council seeking recovery of more than Rs. 1 billion in alleged unpaid Value Added Tax (VAT).\n\nThe Commissioner General of Inland Revenue has filed action before the Colombo Magistrate\u2019s Court requesting an order to recover approximately Rs. 1,034 million allegedly owed to the Government by the CMC.\n\nThe Colombo Municipal Council has been named as the respondent in the case."
