    "description": "Will Sri Lanka need an 18th IMF Program?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Will-Sri-Lanka-need-an-18th-IMF-Program/4-792527",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
