    "description": "Health experts urge vigilance over suspected Ebola case in India",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Health-experts-urge-vigilance-over-suspected-Ebola-case-in-India/108-341357",
    "lang": "en",
