    "chunk_text": "US hospital chain tests Sinque Numberless Patient Monitoring Solution\n\nEFutures team in Sri Lanka testing Sinque, the innovative patient monitoring platform now being piloted by a US hospital chain\n\nSinque, a patient monitoring system that focuses on numberless behavioural analytics, to deliver obesity care that is emotionally safe, especially for GLP-1 weight loss programs, built and implemented by Sri Lankan technology outsourcing company EFutures, together with leadership from the application\u2019s founders in the Netherlands, is now being tested by a leading hospital chain across the United States.\n\nSinque has only recently gained traction through its milestone testing phase, in the United States. A patient monitoring application that offers patient insights via predictive behavioural analytics, Sinque is now growing in popularity for obesity care, especially GLP-1 programs that administer medications for weight loss."
