    "chunk_size_bytes": 1330,
    "chunk_text": "ADRA Ceylon redefines Sri Lanka\u2019s tea export narrative\n\nADRA Ceylon, an entity within the Pink Eagle Group, marks its 10th anniversary, celebrating a decade of remarkable transformation from a local venture into a globally recognized leader in premium Ceylon tea export.\n\nSince its inception, the company has successfully delivered exquisite teas to over 37 countries, firmly establishing its position among Sri Lanka\u2019s tea exporters. This significant milestone reflects the strategic vision and unwavering commitment that have propelled ADRA Ceylon to international prominence.\n\nReflecting on the achievement, Asitha Silva, Founder of ADRA Ceylon stated, \u201cWe are immensely proud to celebrate a decade of excellence driven by passion, an unwavering commitment to quality, and the trust our partners place in us. As we move forward, we remain dedicated to innovating responsibly to take the taste of Ceylon to the world.\u201d\n\nInitially entering the global market as a bulk tea exporter, ADRA Ceylon has built a strong foundation through its steadfast adherence to exemplary product quality, consistency, and strategic market expansion. Over the years, the company has progressively amplified its business model with a focus on value-added tea products to enhance brand presence and capture greater value within global markets."
