    "description": "\u2018SmartChat Mega - Kandy\u2019 accelerates SME digital transformation for the Central Province",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/SmartChat-Mega-Kandy-accelerates-SME-digital-transformation-for-the-Central-Province/34-792600",
