    "description": "\u2019Breakneck\u2019 Ebola epidemic in Congo outpaces world\u2019s response",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Breakneck-Ebola-epidemic-in-Congo-outpaces-worlds-response/108-341502",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
