    "description": "Government lacks votes, not funds: Dayasiri slams election delays",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Government-lacks-votes-not-funds-Dayasiri-slams-election-delays/108-341505",
    "lang": "en",
