    "chunk_text": "Dr. Binod Chaudhary champions Global Business Leadership\n\nDr. Binod Chaudhary, Chairman of CG Corp Global and Nepal\u2019s preeminent billionaire, shared profound insights on navigating the complexities of global business leadership at Chairman &CEO Forum, organized by the Sri Lanka Institute of Directors (SLID) together with Union Bank and Port City. At the event as a symbolic gesture Dr. Chaudhary presented a signed copy of his book Made in Nepal, which chronicles his journey of building a global conglomerate from the Himalayas to Krishan Balendra, Chairperson of John Keells Holdings PLC.\n\nAitken Spence Printing achieves historic milestone with WorldStar 2026 win for Sri Lanka\u2019s offset printing industry\n\nTokyo Cement posts strong FY2025/26 Q4 performance amid intense cost pressures\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
