    "chunk_text": "Volkswagen Taigun, Virtus launched\n\nContinental Cars & Commercials Pvt Ltd, the official authorized importer of Volkswagen passenger vehicles in Sri Lanka, ceremonially launched the all-new Volkswagen Taigun and Volkswagen Virtus at the Bandaranaike Memorial International Conference Hall (BMICH) this evening, marking a significant milestone for the brand\u2019s presence in the country.\n\nThe high-profile launch event highlighted a new era of German engineering, innovation, and premium mobility tailored for modern Sri Lankan consumers, reinforcing Volkswagen\u2019s long-term commitment to the local automotive market.\n\nThe event brought together senior representatives from the Volkswagen Group, diplomats, government officials, corporate leaders, business community members, media personnel, industry stakeholders, and automotive enthusiasts.\n\nThe evening featured an immersive unveiling experience with advanced digital presentations, cultural performances, executive addresses, entertainment segments, and dynamic product showcases, reflecting Volkswagen\u2019s global standards in engineering excellence, safety, technology, and contemporary design. Pix by Nimalsiri Edirisinghe"
  },
