    "chunk_text": "The centre also highlights how LG drives innovation across specific sectors such as retail through LG\u2019s Retail Signage Solutions, creating engaging in-store experiences using vivid digital displays. These are powered by smart management tools such as SuperSign CMS and LG ConnectedCare, allowing businesses to manage content remotely and ensure system uptime.\n\nAdditionally, in recognition of the rapidly evolving hospitality and healthcare industries, LG has introduced its dedicated Pro TV Solutions together with Pro Cloud and Pro Direct software management platforms, which are available on selected hotel and healthcare TV models. These solutions help hotels and hospitals enhance guest and patient experiences, streamline content management, improve operational efficiency, and meet rising service expectations through smarter digital integration.\n\nSpeaking at the launch, Keith Chung emphasised the commitment to help businesses operate smarter; \u201cAs a leader in digital transformation, LG is committed to helping businesses operate in more flexible environments. This Innovation Centre demonstrates how integrated AV and information display solutions can drive innovation across every aspect of a client\u2019s operations.\u201d\n\nRusi Pestonjee added, \u201cAbans is proud to partner with LG to bring this pioneering initiative to Sri Lanka. By offering end-to-end commercial solutions under one roof, we are empowering local businesses to exceed their operational goals and embrace the future of digital integration.\u201d\n\nThe LG Business Innovation Centre at Abans Elite branch in Colombo 03 is now open for customer visits and demo sessions, for businesses seeking to revolutionise their commercial display and audio-visual strategies with LG solutions."
