    "description": "Humanoid robots \u2019the future\u2019 of car making, says BMW",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Humanoid-robots-the-future-of-car-making-says-BMW/108-341544",
    "lang": "en",
