    "chunk_text": "Trial in Namal\u2019s Krrish case to commence on July 7\n\nColombo, May 29 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Colombo High Court today fixed July 7, 2026, for the commencement of the trial in the case filed against Parliamentarian Namal Rajapaksa over the controversial Krrish transaction.\n\nThe case, instituted by the Attorney General, was taken up before the Colombo High Court this morning, where the pre-trial conference was concluded.\n\nFollowing the completion of preliminary proceedings, the High Court bench ordered that the matter be called for trial in July.\n\nThe Attorney General has alleged that Namal Rajapaksa committed criminal breach of trust by obtaining Rs. 70 million from the Indian Krrish company, claiming that the funds were intended for the promotion of rugby in Sri Lanka."
