    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka announce squad for ICC Women\u2019s T20 World Cup 2026\n\nColombo, May 29 (Daily Mirror) :The Sri Lanka Cricket Selection Panel has named a 15-member squad for the ICC Women\u2019s T20 World Cup 2026, with all-rounder Chamari Athapaththu set to lead the side.\n\nSri Lanka will depart for England on 3 June 2026 ahead of the tournament, which is scheduled to be held from 12 June to 5 July across England and Wales."
