    "chunk_size_bytes": 1515,
    "chunk_text": "Humans are accustomed to introspection-ruminating on past \u2018baggage\u2019, memories etc., in most of their free moments. Functional Magnetic Imaging (fMRI), scans show the Default Mode Network (DMN), is the major neuronal network (See Fig: across), wherein in which much of DMN activity occurs. In contrast the Task based network, the Central Executive Network, is activated in living in the \u2018now\u2019. Mindfulness Meditation is in the latter category. Persistent, prolonged meditation has been shown to suppress the DMN. Making the Mind transcend from a mere State to a Trait.\n\nVipassana (Open) -Meditation is a skill that can be acquired by diligent practice. Eastern civilizations have recognized its benefits from times of yore. Though monks are customarily expected to practice this skill, lay-society too could reap its benefits.\n\nHopefully in the future, humans would realize what mental peace is. Avoids the madness that is now going on in the world stage driven by egoism, backed by the armament industry. The goal is achieving the quality of the human mind, that transcends reaction to emotion, cultivates well-being, resilience and happiness.\n\nSome in western society, have realized the worth of \u2018Contemplative Science-meditation as a useful tool to reduce stress related issues in their Corporate Sector. Meditation Based Stress Reduction (MBSR) programs abound in their Psychiatric Clinics. Research related meditative activity in peer reviewed journals, have literally \u2018exploded\u2019 (See Fig: below)."
