    "description": "\u2019Poison seller\u2019 who sold toxic chemicals online to people across world admits aiding suicides",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Poison-seller-who-sold-toxic-chemicals-online-to-people-across-world-admits-aiding-suicides/108-341586",
