    "chunk_text": "Three children reported missing while bathing at Kalametiya beach\n\nThree children aged between 12 and 18 years have been reported missing while bathing in the sea off Kalametiya in Hungama along with their parents, police said.\n\nAccording to police, the incident occurred earlier today, and search and rescue operations are currently underway to locate the missing children.\n\nFurther investigations are being conducted, while authorities continue efforts to trace the children."
